COMP_PLAN_DIR="$(dirname "$Z_HARNESS_PLAN_DIR")/${SLUG}-${COMP_SLUG}"
mkdir -p "$COMP_PLAN_DIR"
```

Write `$COMP_PLAN_DIR/SPEC.md`:

